WEBVTT

00:14:57.890 --> 00:15:00.000
[Woman: Be careful!]

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:06.930
[And the real people building
peace through non-violence]

00:15:08.025 --> 00:15:11.109
[Encounter Point]

00:15:11.856 --> 00:15:15.975
Video: (Ambulance siren)
[Tel Aviv, Israel 1996]

00:15:17.014 --> 00:15:19.463
[Tzvika: My wife Ayelet
called me and said, ]

00:15:19.487 --> 00:15:22.280
["There was a suicide
bombing in Tel Aviv."]

00:15:22.915 --> 00:15:25.427
[Ayelet: What do you know
about the casualties?]

00:15:25.451 --> 00:15:28.271
[Tzvika off-screen:
We're looking for three girls.]

00:15:28.295 --> 00:15:29.571
[We have no information.]

00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:33.976
[Ayelet: One is wounded here, but we
haven't heard from the other three.]